  <p id="c-nanshi-024-wangtansheng:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangtansheng:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDACABA">曇生</persName>好文義，以謙和見稱，曆吏部尚書，太常卿。孝武末，爲呉興太守。明帝初興，與四方同逆，戰敗歸降，被宥，終於中散大夫。</p>
